nt\", \"Critical\"],\n      \"answer\": \"Critical\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"What is implied about the potential impact of the new transportation system on businesses?\",\n      \"options\": [\"It will have a positive effect\", \"It will have no significant impact\", \"It may cause disruption\"],\n      \"answer\": \"It may cause disruption\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"The purpose of the new public transportation system, according to city officials, is:\",\n      \"options\": [\"To reduce traffic congestion and pollution\", \"To create jobs during the construction phase\", \"To improve the overall quality of life for residents\"],\n      \"answer\": \"To reduce traffic congestion and pollution\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
